  "details": "The buttons for face tracking on desktop remain stuck on the quick menu if the game is launched with HUD Detail Level set to off when you launch the game.\n\nThey are non interactable and remain part of the quick menu until you turn on and off the HUD.\n\nTo recreate:\n\n1: Set HUD Detail Level to \"OFF\" in the quick menu settings or main menu settings\n\n2: Close the game\n\n3: Launch in desktop mode",
